{"id":"SEED-SETS-01","stem":"设集合 $A=\\{1,2,3,4\\}$，$B=\\{3,4,5\\}$，求 $A\\cap B$。","answer":"$\\{3,4\\}$","solution":"交集由同时属于两个集合的元素组成，因此 $A\\cap B=\\{3,4\\}$。","grade":10,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":1.5,"knowledge_codes":["sets"],"target_causes":["knowledge_gap","concept_confusion"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-SETS-02","stem":"已知全集 $U=\\{1,2,3,4,5,6\\}$，$A=\\{1,3,5\\}$，求 $\\complement_U A$。","answer":"$\\{2,4,6\\}$","solution":"从全集中去掉属于 $A$ 的元素，得到 $\\complement_U A=\\{2,4,6\\}$。","grade":10,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":1.8,"knowledge_codes":["sets"],"target_causes":["concept_confusion","misreading"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-LOGIC-01","stem":"“$x>2$”是“$x^2>4$”的什么条件？","answer":"充分不必要条件","solution":"$x>2$ 一定推出 $x^2>4$；但 $x^2>4$ 还可能有 $x<-2$，故为充分不必要条件。","grade":10,"question_type":"选择题","difficulty":2.0,"knowledge_codes":["logic"],"target_causes":["concept_confusion","incomplete_cases"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-LOGIC-02","stem":"写出命题“所有实数 $x$ 都满足 $x^2\\ge0$”的否定。","answer":"存在实数 $x$，使得 $x^2<0$","solution":"全称命题的否定是存在量词命题，并将结论 $\\ge0$ 否定为 $<0$。","grade":10,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":2.0,"knowledge_codes":["logic"],"target_causes":["knowledge_gap","formula_condition"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-INEQ-01","stem":"解不等式 $x^2-5x+6<0$。","answer":"$2<x<3$","solution":"因式分解为 $(x-2)(x-3)<0$，二次函数开口向上，在两根之间为负。","grade":10,"question_type":"解答题","difficulty":2.0,"knowledge_codes":["inequalities"],"target_causes":["method_choice","algebra_transform"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-INEQ-02","stem":"若 $a>0$，求 $a+\\frac{4}{a}$ 的最小值。","answer":"$4$","solution":"由基本不等式，$a+\\frac4a\\ge2\\sqrt{4}=4$，当 $a=2$ 时取等号。","grade":10,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":2.5,"knowledge_codes":["inequalities"],"target_causes":["formula_condition","method_choice"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-FUNC-01","stem":"求函数 $f(x)=\\sqrt{2x-1}$ 的定义域。","answer":"$[\\frac12,+\\infty)$","solution":"根号内需非负：$2x-1\\ge0$，解得 $x\\ge\\frac12$。","grade":10,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":1.8,"knowledge_codes":["function-properties"],"target_causes":["knowledge_gap","formula_condition"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-FUNC-02","stem":"判断函数 $f(x)=x^3+x$ 在 $\\mathbb R$ 上的单调性。","answer":"在 $\\mathbb R$ 上严格递增","solution":"若 $x_1<x_2$，则 $x_2^3-x_1^3>0$ 且 $x_2-x_1>0$，所以 $f(x_2)>f(x_1)$。","grade":10,"question_type":"解答题","difficulty":2.8,"knowledge_codes":["function-properties"],"target_causes":["method_choice","reasoning_gap"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-EXPLOG-01","stem":"计算 $\\log_2 8+\\log_2 4$。","answer":"$5$","solution":"$\\log_2 8=3$，$\\log_2 4=2$，故结果为 $5$。","grade":10,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":1.5,"knowledge_codes":["exponential-log"],"target_causes":["knowledge_gap","calculation"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-EXPLOG-02","stem":"解方程 $3^{2x-1}=27$。","answer":"$x=2$","solution":"$27=3^3$，所以 $2x-1=3$，解得 $x=2$。","grade":10,"question_type":"解答题","difficulty":2.0,"knowledge_codes":["exponential-log"],"target_causes":["algebra_transform","calculation"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-MODEL-01","stem":"某商品原价为 100 元，每年价格增长 10%。两年后价格是多少元？","answer":"$121$ 元","solution":"按复利增长，价格为 $100(1+10\\%)^2=121$ 元。","grade":10,"question_type":"解答题","difficulty":2.0,"knowledge_codes":["function-models","exponential-log"],"target_causes":["method_choice","misreading"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-MODEL-02","stem":"函数 $f(x)=x^2-4x+3$ 有几个零点？","answer":"$2$ 个","solution":"$f(x)=(x-1)(x-3)$，零点为 $1,3$，共两个。","grade":10,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":2.0,"knowledge_codes":["function-models","function-properties"],"target_causes":["algebra_transform","concept_confusion"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-TRIGDEF-01","stem":"已知角 $\\alpha$ 的终边经过点 $(3,4)$，求 $\\sin\\alpha$。","answer":"$\\frac45$","solution":"$r=\\sqrt{3^2+4^2}=5$，故 $\\sin\\alpha=\\frac{y}{r}=\\frac45$。","grade":10,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":2.0,"knowledge_codes":["trig-definition"],"target_causes":["knowledge_gap","formula_condition"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-TRIGDEF-02","stem":"将 $150^\\circ$ 化为弧度。","answer":"$\\frac{5\\pi}{6}$","solution":"$150^\\circ\\times\\frac{\\pi}{180^\\circ}=\\frac{5\\pi}{6}$。","grade":10,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":1.5,"knowledge_codes":["trig-definition"],"target_causes":["calculation","knowledge_gap"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-TRIGID-01","stem":"化简 $\\sin^2x+\\cos^2x+2\\sin x\\cos x$。","answer":"$(\\sin x+\\cos x)^2$","solution":"直接使用完全平方公式，原式等于 $(\\sin x+\\cos x)^2$。","grade":10,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":2.0,"knowledge_codes":["trig-identities"],"target_causes":["algebra_transform","method_choice"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-TRIGID-02","stem":"已知 $\\sin x=\\frac35$ 且 $x$ 为锐角，求 $\\cos 2x$。","answer":"$\\frac7{25}$","solution":"$\\cos2x=1-2\\sin^2x=1-2\\cdot\\frac9{25}=\\frac7{25}$。","grade":10,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":2.5,"knowledge_codes":["trig-identities"],"target_causes":["method_choice","calculation"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-TRIGGRAPH-01","stem":"求函数 $y=2\\sin(3x)$ 的最小正周期。","answer":"$\\frac{2\\pi}{3}$","solution":"$y=A\\sin(\\omega x)$ 的最小正周期为 $\\frac{2\\pi}{|\\omega|}$，故为 $\\frac{2\\pi}{3}$。","grade":10,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":2.0,"knowledge_codes":["trig-graphs"],"target_causes":["knowledge_gap","formula_condition"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-TRIGGRAPH-02","stem":"函数 $y=\\sin x+1$ 的值域是什么？","answer":"$[0,2]$","solution":"因为 $-1\\le\\sin x\\le1$，整体加 1 得 $0\\le y\\le2$。","grade":10,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":1.8,"knowledge_codes":["trig-graphs"],"target_causes":["concept_confusion","calculation"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-SC-01","stem":"在 $\\triangle ABC$ 中，$a=3,b=4,C=90^\\circ$，求 $c$。","answer":"$5$","solution":"由余弦定理，$c^2=a^2+b^2-2ab\\cos C=9+16=25$，故 $c=5$。","grade":10,"question_type":"解答题","difficulty":2.0,"knowledge_codes":["sine-cosine-laws"],"target_causes":["method_choice","formula_condition"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-SC-02","stem":"在 $\\triangle ABC$ 中，$a=2,A=30^\\circ,B=45^\\circ$，求 $b$。","answer":"$2\\sqrt2$","solution":"由正弦定理 $\\frac a{\\sin A}=\\frac b{\\sin B}$，得 $b=2\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt2/2}{1/2}=2\\sqrt2$。","grade":10,"question_type":"解答题","difficulty":2.8,"knowledge_codes":["sine-cosine-laws"],"target_causes":["method_choice","calculation"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-VECTOR-01","stem":"已知向量 $\\vec a=(1,2)$，$\\vec b=(3,-1)$，求 $\\vec a\\cdot\\vec b$。","answer":"$1$","solution":"$\\vec a\\cdot\\vec b=1\\times3+2\\times(-1)=1$。","grade":10,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":1.8,"knowledge_codes":["plane-vectors"],"target_causes":["calculation","knowledge_gap"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-VECTOR-02","stem":"若 $\\vec a=(2,k)$ 与 $\\vec b=(1,-1)$ 垂直，求 $k$。","answer":"$2$","solution":"垂直时数量积为零：$2-k=0$，所以 $k=2$。","grade":10,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":2.0,"knowledge_codes":["plane-vectors"],"target_causes":["concept_confusion","algebra_transform"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-COMPLEX-01","stem":"计算 $(1+i)(2-i)$。","answer":"$3+i$","solution":"展开得 $2-i+2i-i^2=3+i$。","grade":10,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":1.8,"knowledge_codes":["complex-numbers"],"target_causes":["calculation","algebra_transform"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-COMPLEX-02","stem":"复数 $z=3-4i$ 的模是多少？","answer":"$5$","solution":"$|z|=\\sqrt{3^2+(-4)^2}=5$。","grade":10,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":1.5,"knowledge_codes":["complex-numbers"],"target_causes":["knowledge_gap","calculation"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-SOLID-01","stem":"一个正方体的棱长为 2，求其体积。","answer":"$8$","solution":"正方体体积为棱长的三次方，即 $2^3=8$。","grade":10,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":1.2,"knowledge_codes":["solid-geometry"],"target_causes":["knowledge_gap","calculation"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-SOLID-02","stem":"圆锥底面半径为 3，高为 4，求体积。","answer":"$12\\pi$","solution":"$V=\\frac13\\pi r^2h=\\frac13\\pi\\cdot9\\cdot4=12\\pi$。","grade":10,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":1.8,"knowledge_codes":["solid-geometry"],"target_causes":["formula_condition","calculation"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-STAT-01","stem":"数据 $1,2,3,4,5$ 的平均数是多少？","answer":"$3$","solution":"平均数为 $\\frac{1+2+3+4+5}{5}=3$。","grade":10,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":1.2,"knowledge_codes":["statistics"],"target_causes":["calculation","knowledge_gap"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-STAT-02","stem":"数据 $2,2,4,4$ 的方差是多少？","answer":"$1$","solution":"平均数为 3，方差为 $\\frac{(2-3)^2+(2-3)^2+(4-3)^2+(4-3)^2}{4}=1$。","grade":10,"question_type":"解答题","difficulty":2.0,"knowledge_codes":["statistics"],"target_causes":["formula_condition","calculation"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-PROB-01","stem":"掷一枚均匀骰子一次，点数为偶数的概率是多少？","answer":"$\\frac12$","solution":"偶数结果有 $2,4,6$ 共 3 个，所有结果 6 个，概率为 $3/6=1/2$。","grade":10,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":1.5,"knowledge_codes":["probability"],"target_causes":["incomplete_cases","calculation"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-PROB-02","stem":"从 5 个红球和 3 个白球中随机取 1 球，取到白球的概率是多少？","answer":"$\\frac38$","solution":"等可能结果共 8 个，其中白球 3 个，概率为 $3/8$。","grade":10,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":1.5,"knowledge_codes":["probability"],"target_causes":["misreading","calculation"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-LINE-01","stem":"求过点 $(1,2)$ 且斜率为 3 的直线方程。","answer":"$y-2=3(x-1)$","solution":"使用点斜式 $y-y_0=k(x-x_0)$，代入得 $y-2=3(x-1)$。","grade":11,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":1.8,"knowledge_codes":["line-circle"],"target_causes":["knowledge_gap","formula_condition"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-LINE-02","stem":"圆 $x^2+y^2-4x+6y-3=0$ 的圆心是什么？","answer":"$(2,-3)$","solution":"配方得 $(x-2)^2+(y+3)^2=16$，圆心为 $(2,-3)$。","grade":11,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":2.2,"knowledge_codes":["line-circle"],"target_causes":["algebra_transform","calculation"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-ELLIPSE-01","stem":"椭圆 $\\frac{x^2}{9}+\\frac{y^2}{4}=1$ 的焦距是多少？","answer":"$2\\sqrt5$","solution":"$a^2=9,b^2=4,c^2=a^2-b^2=5$，焦距为 $2c=2\\sqrt5$。","grade":11,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":2.0,"knowledge_codes":["conic-ellipse"],"target_causes":["knowledge_gap","formula_condition"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-ELLIPSE-02","stem":"椭圆的两焦点为 $(-2,0),(2,0)$，长轴长为 6，写出标准方程。","answer":"$\\frac{x^2}{9}+\\frac{y^2}{5}=1$","solution":"$a=3,c=2$，故 $b^2=a^2-c^2=5$，焦点在 $x$ 轴上。","grade":11,"question_type":"解答题","difficulty":2.8,"knowledge_codes":["conic-ellipse"],"target_causes":["formula_condition","method_choice"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-HYPER-01","stem":"双曲线 $\\frac{x^2}{4}-\\frac{y^2}{9}=1$ 的渐近线方程是什么？","answer":"$y=\\pm\\frac32x$","solution":"标准双曲线渐近线为 $y=\\pm\\frac ba x$，这里 $a=2,b=3$。","grade":11,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":2.2,"knowledge_codes":["conic-hyperbola"],"target_causes":["knowledge_gap","formula_condition"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-HYPER-02","stem":"双曲线 $\\frac{x^2}{9}-\\frac{y^2}{16}=1$ 的焦距是多少？","answer":"$10$","solution":"$c^2=a^2+b^2=9+16=25$，$c=5$，焦距为 $2c=10$。","grade":11,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":2.0,"knowledge_codes":["conic-hyperbola"],"target_causes":["concept_confusion","calculation"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-PARA-01","stem":"抛物线 $y^2=8x$ 的焦点坐标是什么？","answer":"$(2,0)$","solution":"与 $y^2=4px$ 比较得 $4p=8$，所以 $p=2$，焦点为 $(2,0)$。","grade":11,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":2.0,"knowledge_codes":["conic-parabola"],"target_causes":["formula_condition","knowledge_gap"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-PARA-02","stem":"焦点为 $(0,1)$、准线为 $y=-1$ 的抛物线方程是什么？","answer":"$x^2=4y$","solution":"顶点为原点且 $p=1$，开口向上，故方程为 $x^2=4py=4y$。","grade":11,"question_type":"解答题","difficulty":2.5,"knowledge_codes":["conic-parabola"],"target_causes":["method_choice","formula_condition"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-SPACEV-01","stem":"空间向量 $\\vec a=(1,0,1)$ 与 $\\vec b=(1,1,0)$ 的数量积是多少？","answer":"$1$","solution":"数量积为 $1\\times1+0\\times1+1\\times0=1$。","grade":11,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":1.8,"knowledge_codes":["space-vectors"],"target_causes":["calculation","knowledge_gap"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-SPACEV-02","stem":"若空间中两个非零向量的数量积为 0，它们的夹角是多少？","answer":"$90^\\circ$","solution":"由 $\\vec a\\cdot\\vec b=|a||b|\\cos\\theta=0$ 且向量非零，得 $\\cos\\theta=0$。","grade":11,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":1.8,"knowledge_codes":["space-vectors"],"target_causes":["concept_confusion","formula_condition"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-SEQ-01","stem":"数列满足 $a_1=1,a_{n+1}=a_n+2$，写出 $a_n$。","answer":"$a_n=2n-1$","solution":"每次增加 2，是首项为 1、公差为 2 的等差数列，故 $a_n=1+2(n-1)=2n-1$。","grade":11,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":2.0,"knowledge_codes":["sequences","arithmetic-sequences"],"target_causes":["method_choice","algebra_transform"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-SEQ-02","stem":"数列 $a_n=n^2+n$，求 $a_5$。","answer":"$30$","solution":"代入 $n=5$，得 $a_5=5^2+5=30$。","grade":11,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":1.2,"knowledge_codes":["sequences"],"target_causes":["calculation","misreading"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-ARITH-01","stem":"等差数列 $1,4,7,\\ldots$ 的第 10 项是多少？","answer":"$28$","solution":"$a_{10}=1+(10-1)\\times3=28$。","grade":11,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":1.5,"knowledge_codes":["arithmetic-sequences"],"target_causes":["formula_condition","calculation"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-ARITH-02","stem":"等差数列前 10 项和为 100，且 $a_1=1$，求 $a_{10}$。","answer":"$19$","solution":"$S_{10}=\\frac{10(a_1+a_{10})}{2}=100$，故 $1+a_{10}=20$，$a_{10}=19$。","grade":11,"question_type":"解答题","difficulty":2.5,"knowledge_codes":["arithmetic-sequences"],"target_causes":["method_choice","algebra_transform"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-GEOSEQ-01","stem":"等比数列 $2,6,18,\\ldots$ 的第 5 项是多少？","answer":"$162$","solution":"公比为 3，$a_5=2\\times3^4=162$。","grade":11,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":1.8,"knowledge_codes":["geometric-sequences"],"target_causes":["formula_condition","calculation"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-GEOSEQ-02","stem":"等比数列首项为 1、公比为 2，求前 5 项和。","answer":"$31$","solution":"$S_5=\\frac{1(1-2^5)}{1-2}=31$。","grade":11,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":2.0,"knowledge_codes":["geometric-sequences"],"target_causes":["formula_condition","calculation"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-DERIV-01","stem":"求函数 $f(x)=x^3-2x$ 的导数。","answer":"$f'(x)=3x^2-2$","solution":"利用幂函数求导公式，$(x^3)'=3x^2$，$(-2x)'=-2$。","grade":11,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":1.8,"knowledge_codes":["derivatives"],"target_causes":["knowledge_gap","calculation"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-DERIV-02","stem":"曲线 $y=x^2$ 在点 $(1,1)$ 处的切线方程是什么？","answer":"$y=2x-1$","solution":"$y'=2x$，在 $x=1$ 处斜率为 2，点斜式得 $y-1=2(x-1)$。","grade":11,"question_type":"解答题","difficulty":2.2,"knowledge_codes":["derivatives"],"target_causes":["method_choice","formula_condition"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-DAPP-01","stem":"判断函数 $f(x)=x^2-4x$ 的单调区间。","answer":"在 $(-\\infty,2)$ 上递减，在 $(2,+\\infty)$ 上递增","solution":"$f'(x)=2x-4$。当 $x<2$ 时导数为负，当 $x>2$ 时导数为正。","grade":11,"question_type":"解答题","difficulty":2.5,"knowledge_codes":["derivative-applications"],"target_causes":["concept_confusion","reasoning_gap"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-DAPP-02","stem":"求函数 $f(x)=x^3-3x$ 在区间 $[-2,2]$ 上的最大值。","answer":"$2$","solution":"$f'(x)=3x^2-3=0$ 得 $x=\\pm1$。比较 $f(-2)=-2,f(-1)=2,f(1)=-2,f(2)=2$，最大值为 2。","grade":11,"question_type":"解答题","difficulty":3.2,"knowledge_codes":["derivative-applications"],"target_causes":["incomplete_cases","method_choice"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-COUNT-01","stem":"从 5 名学生中选 2 名参加比赛，共有多少种选法？","answer":"$10$","solution":"不计顺序，选法数为 $\\binom52=10$。","grade":12,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":1.8,"knowledge_codes":["counting-binomial"],"target_causes":["concept_confusion","calculation"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-COUNT-02","stem":"求 $(1+x)^5$ 展开式中 $x^2$ 的系数。","answer":"$10$","solution":"$x^2$ 的系数为 $\\binom52=10$。","grade":12,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":2.0,"knowledge_codes":["counting-binomial"],"target_causes":["knowledge_gap","formula_condition"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-COND-01","stem":"袋中有 3 个红球、2 个白球，不放回取两次。已知第一次取到红球，第二次取到白球的概率是多少？","answer":"$\\frac12$","solution":"第一次取红球后剩 2 红 2 白，共 4 球，第二次白球概率为 $2/4=1/2$。","grade":12,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":2.5,"knowledge_codes":["conditional-probability"],"target_causes":["misreading","formula_condition"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-COND-02","stem":"若 $P(A)=0.6$，$P(A\\cap B)=0.3$，求 $P(B|A)$。","answer":"$0.5$","solution":"$P(B|A)=\\frac{P(A\\cap B)}{P(A)}=0.3/0.6=0.5$。","grade":12,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":2.0,"knowledge_codes":["conditional-probability"],"target_causes":["formula_condition","calculation"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-RV-01","stem":"随机变量 $X$ 取 0、1，概率均为 $0.5$，求 $E(X)$。","answer":"$0.5$","solution":"$E(X)=0\\times0.5+1\\times0.5=0.5$。","grade":12,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":1.8,"knowledge_codes":["random-variables"],"target_causes":["knowledge_gap","calculation"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-RV-02","stem":"随机变量 $X$ 的分布为 $P(X=1)=0.4,P(X=3)=0.6$，求 $D(X)$。","answer":"$0.96$","solution":"$E(X)=2.2$，$E(X^2)=5.8$，故 $D(X)=5.8-2.2^2=0.96$。","grade":12,"question_type":"解答题","difficulty":2.8,"knowledge_codes":["random-variables"],"target_causes":["formula_condition","calculation"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-BINOM-01","stem":"若 $X\\sim B(10,0.3)$，求 $E(X)$。","answer":"$3$","solution":"二项分布期望为 $np=10\\times0.3=3$。","grade":12,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":1.8,"knowledge_codes":["binomial-distribution"],"target_causes":["knowledge_gap","formula_condition"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-BINOM-02","stem":"独立重复试验 4 次，每次成功概率为 $\\frac12$，恰好成功 2 次的概率是多少？","answer":"$\\frac38$","solution":"概率为 $\\binom42(\\frac12)^2(\\frac12)^2=6/16=3/8$。","grade":12,"question_type":"解答题","difficulty":2.5,"knowledge_codes":["binomial-distribution"],"target_causes":["method_choice","calculation"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-NORMAL-01","stem":"若 $X\\sim N(0,1)$，根据对称性，$P(X>0)$ 等于多少？","answer":"$0.5$","solution":"标准正态分布关于 0 对称，左右两侧概率各为 0.5。","grade":12,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":1.5,"knowledge_codes":["normal-distribution"],"target_causes":["concept_confusion","knowledge_gap"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-NORMAL-02","stem":"一组数据全部加 3 后，方差如何变化？","answer":"方差不变","solution":"所有数据同时平移只改变均值，不改变各数据与均值的离差，因此方差不变。","grade":12,"question_type":"选择题","difficulty":2.0,"knowledge_codes":["normal-distribution","statistics"],"target_causes":["concept_confusion","reasoning_gap"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-CFUNC-01","stem":"已知 $f(x)=x^3-3x+a$，若 $f(x)$ 有三个不同实根，求 $a$ 的取值范围。","answer":"$-2<a<2$","solution":"$f'(x)=3x^2-3$，极大值 $f(-1)=a+2$，极小值 $f(1)=a-2$。有三个不同实根需极大值大于 0 且极小值小于 0，即 $a>-2$ 且 $a<2$。","grade":12,"question_type":"解答题","difficulty":4.0,"knowledge_codes":["comprehensive-functions","derivative-applications"],"target_causes":["method_choice","incomplete_cases"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-CFUNC-02","stem":"若函数 $f(x)=x^2+ax+1$ 在 $[0,+\\infty)$ 上单调递增，求 $a$ 的取值范围。","answer":"$a\\ge0$","solution":"$f'(x)=2x+a$。要对一切 $x\\ge0$ 有 $f'(x)\\ge0$，最小值在 $x=0$ 取得，故 $a\\ge0$。","grade":12,"question_type":"解答题","difficulty":3.5,"knowledge_codes":["comprehensive-functions","derivative-applications"],"target_causes":["formula_condition","reasoning_gap"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-CGEO-01","stem":"直线 $y=x+m$ 与圆 $x^2+y^2=1$ 相切，求 $m$。","answer":"$m=\\pm\\sqrt2$","solution":"圆心到直线 $x-y+m=0$ 的距离为 1，故 $\\frac{|m|}{\\sqrt2}=1$，得 $m=\\pm\\sqrt2$。","grade":12,"question_type":"解答题","difficulty":3.2,"knowledge_codes":["comprehensive-geometry","line-circle"],"target_causes":["method_choice","incomplete_cases"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-CGEO-02","stem":"过椭圆 $\\frac{x^2}{4}+y^2=1$ 的右顶点作斜率为 $k$ 的直线。写出该直线方程。","answer":"$y=k(x-2)$","solution":"椭圆右顶点为 $(2,0)$，由点斜式得到 $y-0=k(x-2)$。","grade":12,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":2.5,"knowledge_codes":["comprehensive-geometry","conic-ellipse"],"target_causes":["misreading","formula_condition"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-ALG-01","stem":"解方程 $2x-5=9$。","answer":"$x=7$","solution":"移项得 $2x=14$，两边同除以 $2$，得到 $x=7$。","grade":10,"question_type":"解答题","difficulty":1.2,"knowledge_codes":["algebra-operations"],"target_causes":["algebra_transform","calculation"],"verified":true}
{"id":"SEED-ALG-02","stem":"已知 $x+y=5$，$xy=6$，求 $x^2+y^2$。","answer":"$13$","solution":"由 $x^2+y^2=(x+y)^2-2xy$，得 $x^2+y^2=25-12=13$。","grade":10,"question_type":"填空题","difficulty":1.8,"knowledge_codes":["algebra-operations"],"target_causes":["formula_condition","calculation"],"verified":true}
